hrough the expansion's storyline._\n**Tier 1**\nTempest Temple\n_This is an open zone._\nKatta Castrum: Deluge\n_This is an open zone._\n\n---\n\n**Tier 2**\nBrother Island\n_As of December 11, 2014, this is an open zone._\nCaverns of Endless Song\n_Access to the Caverns of Endless Song is granted upon:_\n\\- Completion of \" A Rising Storm [quest=7702]\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \" Gathering Clouds [quest=7703]\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \" Clearer Skies [quest=7704]\" (Tempest Temple)\n\\- Completion of \" The Pellarus Satum [quest=7705]\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\\- Completion of \" The Edge of Balance [quest=7706]\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\\- Completion of \" The Abscent Scholar [quest=7707]\" (Katta Castrum: Deluge)\n\n---\n\n**Tier 3**\nDegmar, the Lost Castle\n_Access to Degmar is granted upon:_\n\\- Completion of \" Just Recompense [quest=7708]\" (Brother Island)\n\\- Completion of \" The Cover of Night [quest=7709]\" (Brother Island)\n\\- Completion of \" Loyal is the Heart [quest=7710]\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\n\\- Completion of \" Leave No Brother Behind [quest=7711]\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\n\\- Completion of \" Two Sides of the Shield [quest=7712]\" (Caverns of Endless Song)\nThuliasaur Island\n_Access to Thuliasaur Island is granted upon:_\n\\- Completion of \" The Sacred Profaned [quest=7713]\" (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n\\- Completion of \" Crying for the Dead [quest=7714]\" (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n\\- Completion of \" Burden of the Past [quest=7715]\" (Degmar, the Lost Castle)\n_Note: In order to request \"Crying for the Dead\" (solo task), you must have completed \" Castle Relic [quest=7757]\" (the heroic adventure for Degmar). In order to get credit for the heroic adventure, you must be in the zone at the time of its completion. In order to zone into the instance (or request it), you must be of apprehensive+ faction with Degmar's Commoners (increased by completing \" Castle Raid [quest=7747]\" and \" Castle Crasher [quest=7748]\"). None of these tasks are technically counted as part of progression._\nCombine Dredge\n_Access to Combine Dredge is granted upon:_\n\\- Completion of \" An Endless Cycle [quest=7716]\" (Thuliasaur Island)\n\\- Completion of \" To Remake Eden [quest=7717]\" (Thuliasaur Island)\n\\- Completion of \" Fit for the New World [quest=7718]\" (Thuliasaur Island)\nArx Mentis\n_Access to Arx Mentis is granted upon:_\n\\- Completion of \" A Fickle Wind Blows [quest=7719]\" (Combine Dredge)\n\\- Completion of \" What Hate Begets [quest=7720]\" (Combine Dredge)\n\\- Completion of \" Deep Lies the Snow [quest=7721]\" (Combine Dredge)\n\n---\n\nRaiding\n_To request the Arx Mentis raid, you must have:_\n\\- Completion of \" Free Us From Ourselves [quest=7722]\" (Arx Mentis)\n\\- Completion of \" A Beginning From an End [quest=7723]\" (Arx Mentis)\n\\- Completion of \" All Rivers Lead to the Sea [quest=7724]\" (Arx Mentis)\n\\- Completion of \" The Cost of Balance [quest=7725]\" (Arx Mentis)\n_As of a patch in December 2014:_\n\\- Confronting Calix [quest=8000] (Arx Mentis) - group version of the final raid event.",
